  "instructions": [
    "Rub the butter into the flour and salt, bind with the yolk and water, then chill for 30 minutes.",
    "Roll out and line a 23cm tin, prick the base and chill again while the oven heats to 190C.",
    "Blind bake for 15 minutes, lift out the beans and bake 8 minutes more until sandy.",
    "Soften the onion and garlic in the oil, then stir through the drained spinach.",
    "Beat the ricotta, eggs, milk, parmesan, lemon zest and nutmeg and season well.",
    "Spread the spinach over the case, pour in the custard and bake for 30 to 35 minutes.",
